Dante - Devil May Cry
Passive Effects:
Pick a weapon from each of 3 menus on spawn, one primary, one secondary, one knife. You are restricted to those weapons for the round. Spawn with 110 HP and double jump. It requires double the normal XP to level this race. You cannot spend level bank levels on this race.
Item Restrictions: 
Cannot buy Boots of Zephyr or Sock of Feather

Stylish Combos - (Special) - 5 Levels
Unlock weapons for your spawn menus. If you do not have the levels for a weapon on a menu, you get the base weapon.
Primary Menu
Level 0: Cerberus// MP7
Level 3: Coyote-A// Sawed-off
Level 5: Kalina Ann// AWP

Secondary Menu
Level 0: Ebony and Ivory// Dualies
Level 3: Blue Rose// Deagle

Melee Menu
Level 5: Agni// Knife
Level 5: Rudra// Knife

Arsenal - (Ability1) - 5 Levels
Activate to upgrade the weapon you have in your hand when you press Ability1. Upgrades are below. 20/19/18/17/16 second cooldown.
-Cerberus: Has perfect accuracy and no recoil, but fires in 3 round bursts for the next 10 seconds.
-Coyote-A: Your next shot uses all the ammo in your current mag but causes knockback and deals the damage dealt in a huge cone.
-Kalina Ann: Your next shot deals 60 damage to all enemies in a 200 unit radius of where it impacts.
-Ebony and Ivory: 100% increased fire rate for 10 seconds.
-Blue Rose: Deal double damage but spend 2 rounds per shot for 10 seconds.
-Agni: Your next hit deals 40 damage to all enemies in a 200 unit radius of the enemy you hit.
-Rudra: Your next hit impales the enemy high into the air and deals 5 damage per second for 5 seconds.

 Devilish Stance - (Ability2) - 5 Levels
Pick an effect from the menu to be active. Picking a new effect removes the old effect. 1.5 second cooldown.

Stances Menu:
-Trickster: Your double jump height is increased. Increases height with levels. Maxed out this should allow you to jump from CT spawn to cat on dust2.
-Swordmaster: You deal 6/7/8/9/10 extra damage on hit with the knife.
-Gunslinger: You deal 8/16/24/32/40% extra damage on hits with guns.
-Royal Guard: Your max HP is increased by 10/15/20/25/30. You are not healed with this effect.

Devil Trigger - (Ultimate) - 5 Levels - Requires Level 8
For the next 10 seconds, you gain 20% increased movement speed and 10% increased damage on hit. You heal for 20/25/30/35/40 HP. 35 second cooldown.

